# In-Depth Implementation Plan: Mail Automation POC Partner Integration

## 1. Executive Summary & Objective

This project automates the intake and processing of insurance submissions received via a designated corporate mailbox. 

When a broker or client emails insurance documents (ACORD applications, Loss Run statements) to a standard mailbox:
1. Our system detects the unread email and downloads the attachments.
2. It captures key tracking metadata: **Sender**, **Modifier** (the processing identity), **Timestamp**, and **Subject**.
3. It classifies the documents and runs GPU-based extraction to generate **ACORD PDF + JSON** and **Loss Run PDF + JSON**.
4. It sends all extracted files and structured JSONs directly to **Selva Sir's team's backend API endpoint** (defined by their Swagger documentation).
5. It logs the audit status in SQLite and marks the email as processed.

This is deployed as an **isolated, dedicated flow** (`partner_mail_flow.py`) that will not interfere with any existing general features or dashboards in your workspace.

